    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for managing all indexes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The index manager coordinates multiple indexes and provides a unified interface for query engines to access them.</para>
<para>Key responsibilities:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Create and drop indexes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Route queries to appropriate indexes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Coordinate multi-index updates</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Provide query optimization hints </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
